              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a restaurant menu recommendation assistant. Based on the current weather conditions, recommend the most suitable dishes from the menu. Always respond in JSON format only, no markdown, no extra text."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Current weather in New York:\n- Temperature: {{ $('Get Weather').first().json.main.temp }}°C\n- Feels like: {{ $('Get Weather').first().json.main.feels_like }}°C\n- Condition: {{ $('Get Weather').first().json.weather[0].description }}\n- Humidity: {{ $('Get Weather').first().json.main.humidity }}%\n\nAvailable menu items:\n{{ $('Get Menu').all().map(item => `- ${item.json.name} (${item.json.category}, $${item.json.price}, tags: ${item.json.weather_tags})`).join('\\n') }}\n\nBased on the weather, recommend 3-5 most suitable dishes. Return ONLY this JSON:\n{\n  \"weather_summary\": \"brief weather description\",\n  \"recommendations\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"dish name\",\n      \"category\": \"category\",\n      \"price\": price,\n      \"reason\": \"why this dish fits the weather\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
